{"suttaId":"sn48.8","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-v","vriCode":"s0305m.mul","paras":[1170,1170],"vripara":"478"},"segments":{"sn48.8:0.3":"Daṭṭhabbasuttaṃ","sn48.8:1.1":"“Pañcimāni, bhikkhave, indriyāni.","sn48.8:1.2":"Katamāni pañca?","sn48.8:1.3":"Saddhindriyaṃ … pe … paññindriyaṃ.","sn48.8:1.4":"Kattha ca, bhikkhave, saddhindriyaṃ daṭṭhabbaṃ?","sn48.8:1.5":"Catūsu sotāpattiyaṅgesu – ettha saddhindriyaṃ daṭṭhabbaṃ.","sn48.8:1.7":"Kattha ca, bhikkhave, vīriyindriyaṃ daṭṭhabbaṃ?","sn48.8:1.8":"Catūsu sammappadhānesu – ettha vīriyindriyaṃ daṭṭhabbaṃ.","sn48.8:1.10":"Kattha ca, bhikkhave, satindriyaṃ daṭṭhabbaṃ?","sn48.8:1.11":"Catūsu satipaṭṭhānesu – ettha satindriyaṃ daṭṭhabbaṃ.","sn48.8:1.13":"Kattha ca, bhikkhave, samādhindriyaṃ daṭṭhabbaṃ?","sn48.8:1.14":"Catūsu jhānesu – ettha samādhindriyaṃ daṭṭhabbaṃ.","sn48.8:1.16":"Kattha ca, bhikkhave, paññindriyaṃ daṭṭhabbaṃ?","sn48.8:1.17":"Catūsu ariyasaccesu – ettha paññindriyaṃ daṭṭhabbaṃ.","sn48.8:1.19":"Imāni kho, bhikkhave, pañcindriyānī”ti.","sn48.8:1.20":"Aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-v","bookName":"Mahāvagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0305t.tik","from":459,"to":459,"paras":[{"para":459,"vripara":"478","refs":["sn48.8:1"],"lines":["Soto āpajjīyati etenāti <b>sotāpatti,</b> anāgataṃ pati paṭhamamaggo.","<b>Soto</b>ti ariyamaggasoto daṭṭhabbo.","<b>Āpajjīyatī</b>tiādito paṭipajjīyati.","Paṭhamamaggapaṭilābhanimittāni sotāpannassa aṅgāni idha <b>“sotāpattiyaṅgānī”</b>ti vuttāni.","Tāni pana tīsu ṭhānesu saddhā ariyakantasīlañcāti veditabbāni.","<b>Savisaye</b>ti sakavisaye.","<b>Jeṭṭhakabhāvadassanatthan</b>ti padhānabhāvadassanatthaṃ.","Yattha saddhādiindriyānaṃ sātisayakiccaṃ, tesaṃ kiccātirekataṃ dassetunti attho.","Idāni tamatthaṃ upamāhi vibhāvetuṃ <b>“yathā hī”</b>tiādi vuttaṃ.","<b>Patvā</b>ti attano kiccātirekaṭṭhānaṃ paṭilabhitvā.","<b>Pubbaṅgaman</b>ti saddahanakiccesu purecāraṃ dhorayhaṃ.","<b>Sesāni</b> vīriyindriyādīni.","<b>Tadanvayānī</b>ti tadanugatāni tassa saddhindriyādikassa pakkhikāni.","Esa nayo sesesupi.","<b>Jhānavimokkhe</b>ti jhānasaṅkhāte vimokkhe samādhipadhānatāya jhānānaṃ.","Evañca katvā “sotāpattiyaṅgāni patvā”ti idañca vacanaṃ samatthitaṃ hoti.","Saddhūpanisañhi sīlanti.","<b>Ariyasaccāni patvā</b>ti cattāri saccāni abhisametabbāni pāpuṇitvā."],"lineRefs":[["sn48.8:1"],["sn48.8:1"],["sn48.8:1"],["sn48.8:1"],["sn48.8:1"],["sn48.8:1"],["sn48.8:1"],["sn48.8:1"],["sn48.8:1"],["sn48.8:1"],["sn48.8:1"],["sn48.8:1"],["sn48.8:1"],["sn48.8:1"],["sn48.8:1"],["sn48.8:1"],["sn48.8:1"],["sn48.8:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn48.8:1.5","sotāpatti",0,0],["sn48.8:1.5","soto",0,1]]}}
